<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 572.58, up 3.86.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 276 to 229.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 18,725,475, compared with 19,267,460 Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
